      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test file, removing unused helper methods, cleaning up unused imports/constants, and improving naming and documentation.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused helper methods and constants, trims the imports to only what's needed, renames `bb` to `emptyBuffer` for clarity, and adds a Javadoc comment explaining the \"allocated-but-empty\" concept — all while preserving the exact same runtime behaviour."
